{
	quest.0149B3F7F08D7E35.quest_subtitle: "A basic crafting component."
	quest.09BE3D92053AE1F8.quest_desc: ["The &eRoller&r is placed one block above the targeted block, similar to a &bMechanical Mixer&r or &bMechanical Press&r. It can be picked up by sneak-using a &bWrench&r on it."]
	quest.0BBE6CADED48A971.quest_desc: [
		"Connect the &eStock Ticker&r to a network by clicking a &bStock Link&r. Place a &bMob in a Seat&r or a &bBlaze Burner&r behind it to create a &dStock Keeper&r."
		""
		"The &dStock Keeper&r allows players to search the network and request items. Locking it prevents other players from accessing its UI, but it will still accept &bShopping Lists&r."
	]
	quest.0EE2E9EB6DC01E34.quest_subtitle: "An essential crafting material."
	quest.135E27A19B935CD7.quest_desc: [
		"The &eFrogport&r takes packages that match its address. Right-click a &bChain Conveyor&r to set the target, then place the &eFrogport&r within 4 blocks."
		""
		"Set the address by right-clicking the placed &eFrogport&r. It will only send packages that do not match its address, unless configured otherwise in its UI."
	]
	quest.147FC2959F9FC5F5.quest_desc: [
		"&eTrains&r are contraptions that travel on &bTrain Tracks&r."
		""
		"To assemble a train, place a &bStation&r near a track and select \"Create Train\". Place &bTrain Casings&r on the track to form bogeys. Add &bTrain Controls&r and a &bSeat&r or &bBlaze Burner&r for the driver."
		""
		"Use &bSuper Glue&r to connect all parts, then assemble the train via the &bStation's&r interface. Errors will be displayed if assembly fails."
	]
	quest.147FC2959F9FC5F5.quest_subtitle: "Construct and customize your own trains."
	quest.177C0E37A35A14F4.quest_desc: [
		"When powered, the &eClockwork Bearing&r rotates an attached structure to the current hour. A second, separate structure can act as the minute hand."
		""
		"The Value Settings Screen allows for changing the hand order or switching to a 24-hour format."
	]
	quest.1837076B0EA3C11A.quest_desc: ["The &eMechanical Belt&r transports items and entities while also transferring &dRotational Force&r. Create one by right-clicking on two &bShafts&r that are aligned in a straight line. The maximum distance between the shafts is 20 blocks."]
	quest.1837076B0EA3C11A.quest_subtitle: "Transports items and transfers rotation."
	quest.19754AE8C11A6317.quest_desc: [
		"The &eDeployer&r simulates player actions on blocks or entities 2 blocks away. It can be given items to use and can be stopped with a &bRedstone Signal&r."
		""
		"A &bFilter&r can be set to specify which items to use."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"By default, the &eDeployer&r simulates right-clicks. Use a &bWrench&r on its front to switch it to left-click mode, allowing it to use tools like pickaxes and swords."
	]
	quest.1B04A295850D0F00.quest_desc: ["The &eTrain Observer&r is used to detect passing &bTrains&r."]
	quest.1B65E8BE91A087DA.quest_desc: [
		"&eChain Conveyors&r can be connected by right-clicking them with a &bChain&r. The maximum connection distance is 32 blocks."
		""
		"They can handle a maximum slope of roughly 1 vertical block for every 2 horizontal blocks."
	]
	quest.1D00D782B8F0B6D6.quest_desc: [
		"The &eMechanical Mixer&r is powered from its internal cogwheel and requires a rotational speed of at least 30 RPM."
		""
		"It must be placed one block above a &bBasin&r. When a valid recipe's ingredients are thrown into the &bBasin&r, the mixer will automatically activate and combine them."
	]
	quest.1DBA8DD396081924.quest_desc: [
		"The &ePortable Fluid Interface&r transfers fluids between a moving contraption and a stationary location."
		""
		"The interfaces must be placed facing each other, 1-2 blocks apart. A &bFluid Pump&r is required to move liquids."
	]
	quest.1FDBB75ECD39FB24.quest_desc: [
		"The &eItem Drain&r can hold up to 1500mb of fluid. A &bFluid Pump&r is needed to extract the fluid from it."
		""
		"A &bBasin&r will automatically deposit output fluids into an adjacent &eItem Drain&r."
	]
	quest.21A830CC8DAD6566.quest_desc: [
		"Place the &eStation&r within 15 blocks of a straight &bTrain Track&r to create trains."
		""
		"Stations can be named in their interface. This name is used by conductors for navigation and will appear on a &bMap&r if used on the station."
	]
	quest.21B40BEC30B40491.quest_desc: [
		"The &eFunnel&r inputs or extracts items from inventories. Sneak-right-clicking places it in input mode."
		""
		"Use a &bWrench&r to switch between input and output modes. It can be disabled with a &bRedstone Signal&r. Right-clicking a &bMechanical Belt&r extends it forward."
	]
	quest.21B40BEC30B40491.title: "Funnel"
	quest.23A9A2D399A7BF94.quest_desc: ["The &eElevator Pulley&r moves a contraption vertically and can phase through blocks. It requires a single horizontal &bRedstone Contact&r on the contraption to assemble."]
	quest.24CFA0022432887E.quest_desc: [
		"The &eThreshold Switch&r emits a &bRedstone Signal&r based on an inventory's fullness. It orients itself towards an adjacent inventory upon placement."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The thresholds for turning the signal on and off can be configured in its UI. The signal can also be inverted."
	]
	quest.24DDED464AE48E05.quest_desc: ["The &eGearshift&r reverses the direction of &dRotational Force&r when it receives a &bRedstone Signal&r."]
	quest.2A404708E175235F.quest_desc: [
		"The &eFluid Tank&r stores liquids."
		""
		"Use &bFluid Pipes&r to insert or extract fluids. The flow direction of the pipes determines whether fluid is added or removed."
		""
		"The window can be toggled with a &bWrench&r."
	]
	quest.2CD70FCC8B119D7A.quest_desc: ["The &eMechanical Pump&r moves fluids through pipes. The arrow symbols indicate the direction of flow, which can be reversed using a &bWrench&r."]
	quest.2E8B8DBE61162084.quest_desc: ["The &eSmart Chute&r functions like a regular &bChute&r but can be filtered to allow only specific items. It can also be configured to extract a set amount of items from an inventory above it."]
	quest.2F0B0D4401AA455E.quest_desc: [
		"The &eAndesite Tunnel&r is placed over a &bMechanical Belt&r, allowing items to pass through while containing the airflow from an &bEncased Fan&r. It can be used to split a single item from a stack to a side output."
		""
		"Use a &bWrench&r to add windows."
	]
	quest.2F0B0D4401AA455E.title: "Tunnel"
	quest.302D29E43E9C9A94.quest_desc: ["When placed next to an inventory, the &ePackager&r creates &bCardboard Packages&r. A &bRedstone Signal&r makes it fill the package as much as possible. Placing a written &bSign&r on the &ePackager&r assigns an address to the package."]
	quest.30A84C6A54BD336E.quest_desc: ["A stationary &eMechanical Drill&r will break the block in front of it. When moved on a &bContraption&r, it breaks blocks it collides with. Its breaking speed and damage depend on the rotational speed or contraption speed."]
	quest.3562111D841CF498.quest_desc: [
		"The &eSequenced Gearshift&r allows for precise control over &dRotational Power&r by executing a series of programmed instructions. You can configure up to five commands, such as turning a specific angle, moving a &bMechanical Piston&r a set distance, or waiting for a timed delay."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Each command's parameters, including angle, distance, and duration, can be adjusted in the UI. The speed and direction of the rotation can also be modified for each step. A &bRedstone Comparator&r can be used to read the current step of the sequence, outputting a signal strength from 1 to 5."
	]
	quest.35C37231C1C86294.quest_desc: [
		"&eSuper Glue&r is used to attach blocks to a contraption. It can be applied block-by-block to a &bChassis&r or used in an area mode to glue a selection of blocks together."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&lBlock by Block Mode&r"
		"Right-click a &bChassis&r face with &eSuper Glue&r to coat it. You can also hold it in your off-hand while placing blocks to glue them automatically."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&lArea Mode&r"
		"Right-click two opposite corners of a selection to glue all blocks within the area."
	]
	quest.35C37231C1C86294.title: "&aSuper Glue"
	quest.3617DE87C4E1BCB9.quest_desc: [
		"The &eHand Crank&r generates a small amount of &dRotational Force&r when right-clicked by a player."
		""
		"The &eWater Wheel&r is a generator of &dRotational Force&r. It generates power when &bWater&r flows over its sides."
	]
	quest.3617DE87C4E1BCB9.title: "Generate Force!"
	quest.383D6F1A001A0AEC.quest_desc: ["The &eChute&r transports items vertically downwards. An &bEncased Fan&r can be used to blow items upwards. The &dSmart Chute&r variant allows for item filtering."]
	quest.38E9C4DB82B1279A.quest_desc: ["The &eContraption Controls&r block allows you to enable or disable actors on a moving contraption, like drills or saws. Apply a filter to control a specific actor."]
	quest.3A2633B6030BBC52.quest_desc: ["While worn, the &eEngineer's Goggles&r display information about mechanical systems, such as stress impact, rotational speed, and the amount of fluid in a &bFluid Tank&r."]
	quest.4181323BF72047A9.quest_desc: ["Give a &eSchedule&r to a conductor (&bSeated Mob&r or &bBlaze Burner&r) to automate a train. The schedule can include commands like traveling to a station or setting a maximum speed."]
	quest.4266BF7FCE3B4330.quest_desc: [
		"The &eShaft&r is a basic mechanical component used to transfer rotational power between other components. &bMechanical Belts&r can be placed on them."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The &eCogwheel&r is a basic component used to relay rotation. Its larger variant, the &eLarge Cogwheel&r, can relay rotation around corners and power &bRotation Speed Controllers&r."
	]
	quest.4266BF7FCE3B4330.quest_subtitle: "The building blocks of rotation."
	quest.4512B97451C2221F.quest_desc: ["The &eMechanical Arm&r can move items between inventories within a 5-block radius. Use a &bWrench&r while hovering over it to see its selected input and output points."]
	quest.45BA5B8A785E1B82.quest_desc: ["The &eWrench&r is used to rotate components and safely dismantle them. Sneak while using it to dismantle blocks that have a right-click function. You can also scroll with the mouse wheel while hovering over certain components to configure them."]
	quest.46004D01A142777E.quest_desc: ["The &eSmart Fluid Pipe&r is a type of &bFluid Pipe&r that can be filtered to allow only a specific liquid to pass through it."]
	quest.4A7F96E62A5845C5.quest_desc: [
		"The &eMechanical Piston&r is a contraption that extends when it receives &dRotational Power&r."
		""
		"It will stop if it collides with an unmovable block. It requires &bPiston Extension Poles&r to extend. Reverse the rotation to retract it. Use a &bSlimeball&r on the end to make it sticky and pull blocks back."
	]
	quest.4B976C143EDA4317.quest_desc: [
		"&eCasings&r are decorative blocks used in many crafting recipes. &dAndesite Casings&r are used for basic contraptions."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Craft casings by applying an &balloy&r or &bingot&r to a &bStripped Log&r. Most casings can be used to encase &bShafts&r, &bCogwheels&r, and &bMechanical Belts&r for decoration. &dCopper Casings&r are exclusively for &bFluid Pipes&r."
	]
	quest.4B976C143EDA4317.quest_subtitle: "A decorative and functional block."
	quest.4B976C143EDA4317.title: "Andesite Casing"
	quest.4C7CD3858A2BE870.quest_desc: ["The &eMechanical Press&r applies pressing and compacting recipes to items placed on a &bDepot&r or &bBasin&r below it. It is powered by a shaft and is used to turn &bIngots&r into &bSheets&r."]
	quest.4D482A1A908ABFDA.quest_desc: ["The &eRadial Chassis&r connects to a radius of blocks around it. Use a &bSlimeball&r or &bSuper Glue&r to make its faces sticky. The radius can be adjusted with a &bWrench&r."]
	quest.4E5C6F23628A9982.quest_desc: ["The &eEncased Chain Drive&r is a component that transfers rotation. Place multiple drives side-by-side, either vertically or horizontally in a straight line, to form a chain that passes power between them."]
	quest.4F78122BABAB041C.quest_desc: ["The &eMechanical Plough&r, when on a moving contraption, breaks non-solid blocks like crops and tall grass. It can also be used to till soil into &bFarmland&r."]
	quest.50CE0BD7B0BC4017.quest_desc: ["The &eFluid Valve&r can stop or allow the flow of liquids when rotational force is applied to its side. This is often done with a &bValve Handle&r or &bGearshift&r."]
	quest.51CCB7ACFD7B45F1.quest_subtitle: "A key crafting ingredient."
	quest.53ADE53114671F23.quest_desc: [
		"The &dCreate&r mod is centered around rotational power, a form of energy generated by water wheels and windmills."
		""
		"Use it to power contraptions and automate your world."
	]
	quest.53ADE53114671F23.quest_subtitle: "An introduction to the mod."
	quest.53ADE53114671F23.title: "Welcome to Create"
	quest.53C0234C053BF0CF.quest_desc: ["Place a &eStock Link&r on a &bPackager&r to connect its inventory to the logistics network. &eStock Links&r have no range limit, but must be in a loaded chunk to function."]
	quest.54778BD66812A1CF.quest_desc: ["The &eFluid Pipe&r is a component used to transport fluids between tanks and machines. It is essential for fluid automation setups."]
	quest.566D6390193DD77D.quest_desc: [
		"The &eBrass Tunnel&r is used on a &bMechanical Belt&r to split, sort, and merge item streams."
		""
		"When placed next to each other, they form a group to collect items from all connected inputs and distribute them among the outputs based on their individual settings."
	]
	quest.5A2450162FD24F7E.quest_desc: ["To use &eCrushing Wheels&r, place two wheels next to each other, one block apart, and power them in opposite directions. Items dropped between them will be crushed."]
	quest.5A2450162FD24F7E.quest_subtitle: "Applies crushing recipes to items."
	quest.5A2450162FD24F7E.title: "Crushing Wheels"
	quest.5AFD4912CC8FBBB8.quest_subtitle: "A necessary crafting component."
	quest.5C2108BD3DEEB0E6.quest_desc: ["The &eSpout&r fills containers with liquids or is used for crafting recipes involving fluids. It must be supplied with a liquid via &bFluid Pipes&r and will dispense it onto items on a &bConveyor Belt&r or &bDepot&r below."]
	quest.605C0B84DFC1A4D5.quest_desc: ["The &eGantry Carriage&r moves along &bGantry Shafts&r when they are powered. Reversing the rotation reverses its direction. Applying a &bRedstone Signal&r to the shaft will stop the carriage."]
	quest.61348E2551E8AD6C.quest_desc: ["The &eRotation Speed Controller&r must be paired with a &bLarge Cogwheel&r. It allows you to set a precise rotation speed output, up to 256 RPM in either direction."]
	quest.626580DB654F128D.quest_desc: ["The &eMillstone&r applies milling recipes, like turning wheat into flour, to any valid items inserted from above."]
	quest.62BAE54B507B7A21.quest_subtitle: "An ingredient for crafting."
	quest.6350ADB7540C368D.quest_desc: [
		"The &eSmart Observer&r emits a &bRedstone Signal&r when it detects a specific item or block."
		""
		"It can observe items on a &bMechanical Belt&r, in a &bFunnel&r, or within a &bFluid Pipe&r."
		""
		"Use a &bFilter&r to specify which item to detect."
	]
	quest.66D9F91519D52482.quest_desc: ["The &eBlaze Cake&r is a special fuel used on a &bBlaze Burner&r to achieve the &dSuper-Heated&r state, which is required for certain advanced recipes."]
	quest.6819665DA7028C9E.quest_subtitle: "Used in multiple crafting recipes."
	quest.6CD96328B7567F46.quest_desc: ["The &eMechanical Harvester&r, when on a moving contraption, will automatically harvest mature crops it comes into contact with."]
	quest.6D03D3B4D83C1840.quest_desc: [
		"The &eMechanical Crafter&r is used for automated crafting. Use a &bWrench&r on its front to set the output direction. Multiple crafters can be placed together to form a crafting grid."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"When powered and all ingredient slots for a valid recipe are filled, the crafters will combine the items into the final product."
	]
	quest.6E8C6A4A07957E5A.quest_desc: ["The &eHose Pulley&r can extend or retract a hose to drain or fill large areas with fluid. It requires a &bFluid Pump&r to move the liquid."]
	quest.719218CEA358D540.quest_desc: ["&eTrain Tracks&r can be placed on the ground or on the side of blocks to create slopes. Use a &bWrench&r while sneaking to safely pick them up."]
	quest.7322A19FDA5B78E1.quest_desc: ["The &eValve Handle&r functions like a &bHand Crank&r but allows you to configure the rotation amount and direction in its UI."]
	quest.732D1A96512F2BFD.quest_desc: [
		"The &eSteam Engine&r is a powerful generator that provides &dRotational Force&r. It has the highest Stress Unit (SU) capacity of any generator in survival mode. To function, it must be placed on a &bFluid Tank&r filled with &bWater&r, which acts as a boiler when heated from below."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"The boiler's power level is determined by three factors: its size, the amount of water, and the heat applied. A single &eSteam Engine&r can only extract a certain amount of power (16,384 SU). To utilize the boiler's full potential, you can attach multiple engines. The power output is transferred using a &bShaft&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"For an active boiler (level 1 or higher), the &bFluid Tank&r must have a capacity of at least 4 blocks per level of heat applied. For instance, a level 9 boiler requires a tank made of at least 36 blocks."
	]
	quest.743C84D1D94C5670.quest_desc: ["The &eBrass Funnel&r is an advanced version of the &bFunnel&r that can be configured to move specific quantities of items, making it useful for precise automation."]
	quest.75E7216AB5411DF6.quest_desc: [
		"The &eMechanical Saw&r, when powered, will chop down trees in front of it. It can fell an entire tree by cutting only the bottom-most log."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"When on a moving contraption, it will damage entities and break wood blocks it comes into contact with."
	]
	quest.768789FEB6EBB8F8.quest_desc: [
		"The &eBlaze Burner&r is a heat source required for certain &bMixing&r recipes, such as creating &dBrass&r. It can also heat a boiler for a &bSteam Engine&r."
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Heating"
		"Right-click it with &bfurnace fuel&r to heat it, or with a &bBlaze Cake&r to &dSuper-Heat&r it for advanced processes."
	]
	quest.768789FEB6EBB8F8.quest_subtitle: "A required heat source for certain recipes."
	quest.76919513DA354DBC.quest_desc: ["The &eGearbox&r transfers &dRotational Power&r in four directions. When one side receives power, the other three sides will output rotation in the opposite direction. It has both horizontal and vertical variants."]
	quest.78A9A4A3089E17B9.quest_desc: [
		"&eCasings&r are decorative blocks used in many crafting recipes. &dCopper Casings&r are exclusively for &bFluid Pipes&r"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Craft casings by applying an &balloy&r or &bingot&r to a &bStripped Log&r. Most casings can be used to encase &bShafts&r, &bCogwheels&r, and &bMechanical Belts&r for decoration."
	]
	quest.7917E75BBA3F0614.quest_desc: ["The &eDisplay Link&r transmits information from a source block to a &bDisplay Board&r. Use the link on a display, then place it on a source. Right-click the link to configure the output text."]
	quest.7B5DF264A026BBD0.quest_desc: ["The &eAdjustable Chain Gearshift&r functions like an &bEncased Chain Drive&r, but its output speed can be toggled with a &bRedstone Signal&r."]
	quest.7C074B5E2A0EAA63.quest_desc: ["The &eTrain Controls&r block is required to operate a train. A &bBlaze Burner&r or &bSeat&r must be placed behind it for a conductor. Right-click the controls to drive the train manually."]
}
